&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/nostalgic-taste&quot;&gt;令人怀念的味道&lt;/a&gt; 著： &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/videogamemonkeymono&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4549537&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609015458&quot; alt=&quot;VideoGameMonkeyMONO&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4549537)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/videogamemonkeymono&quot;  &gt;VideoGameMonkeyMONO&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
