					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="creditRate"> <div class="creditButtonStandalone"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p><strong>标题：</strong>寿司陀螺 中心页<br /> <strong>作者：</strong>©︎寿司陀螺制作委员会<br /> <strong>翻译：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/benjaminchong" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3699277&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609015459" alt="BenjaminChong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3699277)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/benjaminchong" >BenjaminChong</a></span><br /> <strong>发布年份：</strong>2020</p> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/sushiblade-hub/%E5%8B%9D%E5%BA%97%E4%B8%BB/medium.jpg" width="300px" alt="medium.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>光临了您呐。欢迎来到【回转寿司　胜】。</p> <p>……哦。这位客人，你不是来吃寿司的吧？</p> <p>我看你的眼神就知道。你是想转寿司吧？</p> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">👉转寿司……？什么意思？</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">　</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>怎么，客人你不知道？最酷炫的竞技运动——寿司陀螺！</p> <p>好吧，你要不先试一下这个。</p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1134-jp">SCP-1134-JP</a> - <strong>爆旋握饭：寿司陀螺</strong>　著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bamboon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3591242&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609015459" alt="bamboon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3591242)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bamboon" >bamboon</a></span></p> <p><br /></p> <p>怎么样？是不是有点想转寿司了？</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">👉是的！请教教我怎么玩寿司陀螺吧！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">　</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>好！那我先得告诉你有怎样的寿司。先看一看<em><strong>菜单</strong></em>吧。</p> <p>你很在意<em><strong>寿司陀螺玩家</strong></em>吗？还是说，你想要先调查一下都有怎么样的对手？</p> <p>突然和你说寿司陀螺也不明白吧。这里有一本<em><strong>寿司辞典</strong></em>可以用做参考。</p> <p>你在犹豫选什么寿司来转吗？你可以看看这本<em><strong>寿司图册</strong></em>。</p> <p>哦，看来你有干劲了！那么我该教你<em><strong>转寿司的方法</strong></em>了。其实也不难，你放轻松听就好。</p> <p>哎呀，我忘了说了。既然是寿司，可要注意不要<span class="ruby">走漏材料<span class="rt">剧透</span></span>哦？</p> <p><br /></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tabview-d6d3e9868d270e0881061b73abb3eb39" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>菜单</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>寿司陀螺玩家</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>寿司辞典</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>寿司图册</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>转寿司的方法</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p><strong>●跟寿司相关的报告</strong></p> <p><strong>●战斗记录</strong></p> <ul> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushiblade">新节目「握饭降临　寿司陀螺」</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4062604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609015459" alt="Jiraku_Mogana" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4062604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" >Jiraku_Mogana</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sushi-3-2-1-hey-rassyai">最终话前加长版特别节目『回忆中的寿司陀螺！觉醒的三文猛鱼！』</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tutuji" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2206092&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609015459" alt="tutuji" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2206092)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tutuji" >tutuji</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/nostalgic-taste">令人怀念的味道</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/videogamemonkeymono" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4549537&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609015459" alt="VideoGameMonkeyMONO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4549537)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/videogamemonkeymono" >VideoGameMonkeyMONO</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/jet-black">不见五指的黑暗</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" 