gana" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4062604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jiraku-mogana" >Jiraku_Mogana</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/no-sushi-no-life">中枢的寿司陀螺玩家</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tolpo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5230464&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609015459" alt="TOLPO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5230464)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tolpo" >TOLPO</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/shironose-kuzira-2">末摘花京子的人间漫才</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carbon13" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3442755&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609015459" alt="carbon13" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3442755)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carbon13" >carbon13</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sb-ibunden">爆天握饭：寿司陀螺　异闻传</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-kudo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6198158&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609015459" alt="Dr_Kudo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6198158)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-kudo" >Dr_Kudo</a></span></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wagnascousin-2">飞舞于闇中</a> 著： <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wagnascousin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3389120&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609015459" alt="WagnasCousin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=33